 "summary": "The 75-episode TV anime is a near-linear ~2-chapters/episode adaptation of Games 1-148 (volumes 1-17, end of the Sai arc); the Hokuto Cup arc (Games 149-189, vols 19-23) was never adapted by the TV series (only the 2004 New Year special covers its lead-in, loosely). The lattice is pinned by ~30 exact episode-title = chapter-title matches (ja.wikipedia episode titles vs the Game kanji titles on hikago.fandom/Wikipedia) plus explicit chapter fields on the wiki's Episode 1-4/75 and Game 27 pages. Two structural wrinkles: Game 51 ('A Place to Return') is adapted out of order as ep 27 (after the G55-57 material), and ep 50 is a Sai-backstory recap/expansion episode adapting no new mainline chapters. The stored ep75 anchor (END 166 v21) is wrong — every source puts the finale at Game 148, v17 (continue reading at Game 149 / vol 19). Filler/mixed typing (64/66 filler, 65/67 mixed) matches animefillerlist exactly.",
